{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hordes of cordel (folklore) legends in visceral Hack-and-Slash combat. A colonel's farmland is your battlefield. Defend it or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Create builds with devastating powers and upgrades. Turn your enemies' strength into your own weapon and break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedural Sert\u00e3o sculpted in a 2.5D woodcut art style. No two paths are the same. Uncover the dark secrets this land hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOAQUIM'S BURDEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joaquim just wanted one last chance. Now, his fate is tied to a cursed land and the myths that dwell within. His survival is his only burden.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start the campaign","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778860/794481a1bc90a39e71dc96b273c2687411ec5d29.jpg"},{"name":"Pebbles for all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778860/7a1509d9756f36b82f3f6e88a636c08147db91b0.jpg"},{"name":"A new chance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778860/83e11f2944503232eeca98686b78d62c35ff3b15.jpg"},{"name":"Defeated Ghosts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778860/ce97bfa6f644737ff1e4ea284ecb3c41e6b5d3b1.jpg"},{"name":"You got it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778860/79081ee07157f11ee085b9b0d9388fae9921bc49.jpg"},{"name":"As a \"Macho\"!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778860/dbf9ecb67c32834e5830e860e633c21bc8f407b7.jpg"}],"total":6},"background